# The server image is built from the repository root (docker-compose.yml, service wolf-server).
# Everything is left out of the build context except what the Dockerfile copies, so the files
# with secrets (.env), the virtual environment, the evidence and the frontend are never sent to
# the Docker daemon. A new COPY in the Dockerfile needs a line here.
*
!Agents/
!server/
!alembic/
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
